# Allowlist: secrets, Git history, local environments, and tests never enter
# the build context, including when someone adds a new local credential file.
**
!Dockerfile
!.dockerignore
!pyproject.toml
!README.md
!LICENSE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt
!requirements-build.lock
!requirements-http.lock
!scripts/
!scripts/image_inventory.py
!odoo_mcp/
!odoo_mcp/**
odoo_mcp/**/__pycache__/
odoo_mcp/**/*.pyc
